## Styling

To ensure the video embed takes up the entire width of the page you can include the following in your [.scss files](/css/css.qmd).


::: {.cell}

```{.css .cell-code}
.container {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 0;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%;
}
.video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
}
```
:::
